# TastyTrade Daily Report Bundle Prefetch Schedule
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Install with:  crontab -e   (paste the lines below)
# Requires:      TT_USERNAME and TT_PASSWORD set in your crontab environment
#                or sourced from a secrets file (see note below).
#
# Set environment at the top of crontab:
#   TT_USERNAME=your@email.com
#   TT_PASSWORD=your_password
#
# Or source a secrets file before each command:
#   45 7 * * 1-5  source ~/.tt_secrets && python3 ~/path/to/scripts/prefetch.py --report morning
#
# Adjust the path below to your actual clone location.
# All bundles are written to /tmp/tt_brief_<report>.json
#
# Schedule (all times ET — adjust for your timezone):
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Morning brief — 7:45 AM ET Mon–Fri (pre-market account snapshot + futures)
45 7 * * 1-5  TT_USERNAME=your@email.com TT_PASSWORD=your_password python3 ~/tastytrade-mcp/scripts/prefetch.py --report morning

# Open brief — 9:25 AM ET Mon–Fri (5 min before open, delta vs morning)
25 9 * * 1-5  TT_USERNAME=your@email.com TT_PASSWORD=your_password python3 ~/tastytrade-mcp/scripts/prefetch.py --report open

# Noon check — 12:00 PM ET Mon–Fri (midday refresh)
0 12 * * 1-5  TT_USERNAME=your@email.com TT_PASSWORD=your_password python3 ~/tastytrade-mcp/scripts/prefetch.py --report noon

# Pre-close — 3:45 PM ET Mon–Fri (15 min before close, 0DTE flags + circuit breaker)
45 15 * * 1-5 TT_USERNAME=your@email.com TT_PASSWORD=your_password python3 ~/tastytrade-mcp/scripts/prefetch.py --report preclose

# End of day — 4:15 PM ET Mon–Fri (after-hours, realized P&L + growth plan)
15 16 * * 1-5 TT_USERNAME=your@email.com TT_PASSWORD=your_password python3 ~/tastytrade-mcp/scripts/prefetch.py --report eod

# Weekend review — Saturday 9:00 AM (full watchlist scan + weekly P&L summary)
0 9 * * 6     TT_USERNAME=your@email.com TT_PASSWORD=your_password python3 ~/tastytrade-mcp/scripts/prefetch.py --report weekend

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Notes:
# - The morning bundle must run BEFORE open/noon/preclose/eod
#   because intraday reports delta-compress against /tmp/tt_brief_morning.json.
# - If the morning run fails, intraday reports fall back to a full account fetch.
# - Session token is cached at /tmp/tt_session_cache.json (24-hour TTL).
#   Only one login per day regardless of how many reports run.
# - Add >> /tmp/tt_prefetch.log 2>&1 to each line to capture output for debugging.
